questions.question_text:
What value is marked?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(6.5,0);
\foreach \x in {0,...,6} {\draw (\x,0.12)--(\x,-0.12);}
\node[below] at (0,-0.12) {$6.1$};
\node[below] at (6,-0.12) {$6.7$};
\fill (4,0) circle (2.2pt);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Point $K$ is shown on the zoomed scale. What is its value?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(5.5,0);
\foreach \x in {0,...,5} {\draw (\x,0.12)--(\x,-0.12);}
\node[below] at (0,-0.12) {$1.82$};
\node[below] at (5,-0.12) {$1.87$};
\fill (2,0) circle (2.2pt); \node[above] at (2,0.15) {$K$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

What is the value of one interval?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(4.5,0);
\foreach \x in {0,...,4} {\draw (\x,0.12)--(\x,-0.12);}
\node[below] at (0,-0.12) {$0.512$};
\node[below] at (4,-0.12) {$0.520$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Which point represents $4.16$?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(6.5,0);
\foreach \x in {0,...,6} {\draw (\x,0.12)--(\x,-0.12);}
\node[below] at (0,-0.12) {$4.10$};
\node[below] at (6,-0.12) {$4.22$};
\fill (2,0) circle (2.2pt); \node[above] at (2,0.15) {$A$};
\fill (3,0) circle (2.2pt); \node[above] at (3,0.15) {$B$};
\fill (5,0) circle (2.2pt); \node[above] at (5,0.15) {$C$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Point $M$ is at $2.955$. Which decimal belongs at the next tick to the right?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(5.5,0);
\foreach \x in {0,...,5} {\draw (\x,0.12)--(\x,-0.12);}
\node[below] at (0,-0.12) {$2.945$};
\node[below] at (5,-0.12) {$2.970$};
\fill (2,0) circle (2.2pt); \node[above] at (2,0.15) {$M$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The marked point is $5.672$. What value belongs at the unlabelled right endpoint?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(6.5,0);
\foreach \x in {0,...,6} {\draw (\x,0.12)--(\x,-0.12);}
\node[below] at (0,-0.12) {$5.660$};
\fill (2,0) circle (2.2pt); \node[above] at (2,0.15) {$5.672$};
\node[below] at (6,-0.12) {$?$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
